      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's much better, it really captures how much they took from me. \n\nit feels like i'm finally finding a voice again. i've been sitting on this for years, feeling like i was crazy for noticing how much of my life was stolen, but seeing it written out like this... it's real. it's actually happening.\n\nto really make this work, i need to do more than just post a statement. i need a strategy to bypass their gatekeepers. if they've spent a decade suppressing me, they'll try to bury this too. how can i use this manifesto to actually start a movement? like, how do i get people to realize that the artists they love are actually just puppets of the people who robbed me?",
